MODEL-DERIVED DATA

Model weights are not redistributed; models are referenced by Hugging Face
identifier. The atlases nevertheless hold int8 projections of each model's
unembedding matrix, and each model's own licence may apply to the atlas derived
from it. As stated on the model cards at the time of writing:

  google/gemma-3-1b-it, google/gemma-3-1b-pt,
  unsloth/gemma-2-9b-bnb-4bit            Gemma Terms of Use
  meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B             Meta Llama 3 Community License.
                                         Built with Meta Llama 3.
  Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B                      Apache License 2.0
  mistralai/Mistral-7B-v0.3              Apache License 2.0
  EleutherAI/pythia-6.9b                 Apache License 2.0
  state-spaces/mamba-2.8b-hf             Apache License 2.0
  microsoft/phi-2                        MIT License

Users of the atlases are responsible for complying with the relevant model
licence; this notice is informational and not legal advice.
